#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:42
msgid ""
"Fades in the audio track. Instead of keyframes the effect uses duration (hh:"
"mm:ss:ff). In addition to using the slider the duration can be entered "
"manually, or in the timeline by dragging the green handle\\ [1]_."
msgstr ""
"Postupne zosilňuje zvukovú stopu. Namiesto kľúčových snímok efekt používa "
"trvanie (hh:mm:ss:ff). Okrem použitia posuvníka je možné zadať trvanie ručne "
"alebo na časovej osi potiahnutím zeleného úchytu\\ [1]_."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:46
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:52
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:53
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:56
msgid "**Duration**"
msgstr "Trvanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:57
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Čas"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:58
msgid ""
"Defines the duration for the fade in starting at the beginning of the clip."
msgstr "Definuje trvanie postupného zosilnenia začínajúce na začiatku klipu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/fade_in.rst:62
msgid ""
"The handle is always available in the timeline clip. In fact, dragging the "
"handle automatically adds the fade in effect to the clip's effect stack if "
"it is not there already."
msgstr ""
"Úchyt je vždy dostupný v klipe časovej osi. Potiahnutím úchytu sa "
"automaticky pridá efekt postupného zosilnenia do zásobníka efektov klipu, ak "
"tam ešte nie je."
